  "body": "Our Vendors have purchased their next home and are highly motivated to sell, presenting an exceptional opportunity to secure one of Devonport’s finest homes, which is now priced at just $6,200,000. \r\n\r\n‘Anderleigh’ is a truly special estate, rich in history, elegance and character, with magnificent harbour views and access to the beach. This is an opportunity not to be missed! \r\n\r\nWatch the video now to hear the full story of this home.\r\n\r\n•Prestigious Stanley Point position on 1,424sqm of beautifully landscaped grounds.\r\n•A superb north-south aspect offering sheltered outdoor living throughout the seasons.\r\n•Built in the 1920s by renowned Arts and Crafts architect Gerald Jones for industrialist Alex Harvey.\r\n•Masterfully restored and extended, blending heritage charm with modern luxury.\r\n•Beautiful interiors featuring American Oak, Italian marble, leadlights, tongue-and-groove ceilings and Oamaru stone fireplaces.\r\n•Exceptional kitchen with hand-built La Cornue oven, scullery and bespoke Oregon timber island.\r\n•Multiple living and dining spaces flowing to magnificent gardens and outdoor oasis with swimming pool\r\n•Four upstairs bedrooms, including a harbour-view master retreat with two walk-in wardrobes and ensuite.\r\n•Separate Summer House with bedroom, bathroom and kitchenette – perfect for guests, family or teens.\r\n•Two garages and secure off-street parking.\r\n\r\nViewing as advertised or by appointment – contact Linda on 027 459 0957.",
